Description: reBot Robotic Arm Teleoperation and Embodied Vision Daemon for reCamera SG2002
 Integrates auto Wi-Fi AP hotspot, edge TPU YOLOv11 target detection,
 and low-latency serial bus servo control for SO-ARM 101 and reBot arms.
 Provides mobile touch dual-joystick teleoperation and LeRobot Parquet dataset recording.
